{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18390","headline":"南至日隔仗望含元殿香炉 · 郭遵","name":"南至日隔仗望含元殿香炉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冕旒亲负扆，卉服尽朝天。\n阳谷移初日，金炉出御烟。\n芬馨流远近，散漫入貂蝉。\n霜仗凝逾白，朱栏映转鲜。\n如看浮阙在，稍觉逐风迁。\n爲沐皇家庆，来瞻羽卫前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭遵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18390.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18390","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}